  FT["MY-H5372"] = {"id":"MY-H5372","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 386/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年印花税（豁免）（第13号）令","en":"STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION)(NO. 13) ORDER 2021","orig":"STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION)(NO. 13) ORDER 2021","ms":"Perintah Duti Setem (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 13) 2021","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế tem (Miễn trừ) (số 13) năm 2021","th":"คำสั่งอากรแสตมป์ (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 13) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Perintah Bea Meterai (Pembebasan) (Nomor 13) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA386","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2021_P.U.(A)386-2021_STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION)(NO. 13) ORDER 2021.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5372-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Setem (Pengecualian)\n(No. 13) 2021.\n\n (2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Disember 2020.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H5372-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Menteri mengecualikan surat  cara perjanjian  pinjaman atau pembiayaan\nuntuk Kemudahan Bantuan dan Pemulihan Bersasar yang diluluskan di bawah\nTabung Bank Neg ara Malaysia untuk perusahaan kecil d an sederhana yang\ndisempurnakan di antara Bank Negara Malaysia dengan suatu institusi kewangan peserta\ndaripada duti setem.\n\n(2) Pengecualian yang disebut dalam subperenggan (1) hendaklah hanya\nterpakai sekiranya surat cara perjanjian pinjaman atau pembiayaan itu disempurnakan\npada atau selepas 1 Disember 2020 tetapi tidak lewat daripada 31 Disember 2021.\n\n(3) Dalam perenggan ini, \"institusi kewangan peserta\" ertinya—\n\n  (a) Affin Bank Berhad;\n\n(b) Alliance Bank Malaysia Berhad;\n\n(c)  Alliance Islamic Bank Berhad;\n\n(d) AmBank (M) Berhad;\n   (e) Bank Islam Malaysia Berhad;\n\n(f) Bank Kerjasama Rakyat Malaysia Berhad (Bank Rakyat);\n\n(g) Bank Muamalat Malaysia Berhad;\n\n(h) Bank of China (Malaysia) Berhad;\n\n(i) Bank Pertanian Malaysia Berhad (Agrobank);\n\n(j) Bank Simpanan Nasional;\n\n(k) CIMB Bank Berhad;\n\n(l) HSBC Bank Malaysia Berhad;\n\n(m) Hong Leong Bank Berhad;\n\n(n) Malayan Banking Berhad;\n\n(o) MBSB Bank Berhad;\n\n(p) OCBC Bank (Malaysia) Berhad;\n\n(q) Public Bank Berhad;\n\n(r) RHB Bank Berhad;\n\n(s) Small Medium Enterprise Development Bank Malaysia Berhad\n(SME Bank);\n\n(t) Standard Chartered Bank Malaysia Berhad; dan\n\n(u) United Overseas Bank (Malaysia) Bhd.\n\nDibuat 6 Oktober 2021\n[MOF.TAX.700-3/2/138;LHDN.AY.A.600-12/1/7(29)-120; PN(PU2)159/Jld. 35]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMenteri Kewangan\n\nSTAMP ACT 1949\n\nSTAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 13) ORDER 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 80(1) of the Stamp Act 1949 [Act 378],\nthe Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-11"};
  FT["MY-H5373"] = {"id":"MY-H5373","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 386/2022&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年娱乐税（豁免）（第6号）令","en":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 6) ORDER 2022","orig":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 6) ORDER 2022","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế giải trí (Miễn trừ) (số 6) năm 2022","th":"คำสั่งภาษีบันเทิง (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 6) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Perintah Bea Hiburan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 6) Tahun 2022","ms":"Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 6) 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA386","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2022_P.U.(A)386-2022_ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 6) ORDER 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5373-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian)\n\n(No. 6) 2022.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H5373-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Tiket masuk bagi persembahan Jubin Nautiyal Live in Malaysia yang telah\n\ndiadakan di Dewan Plenari, Pusat Konvensyen Kuala Lumpur pada 26 Ogos 2022\n\ndikecualikan daripada duti hiburan.\n\nDibuat 12 Disember 2022\n\n[Perb.MOF.TAX(S)700-1/3/27 JLD.3; PN(PU2)174/XI]\n\n ANWAR BIN IBRAHIM\n\n Menteri Kewangan\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY ACT 1953\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 6) ORDER 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 12(1)(b) of the\n\nEntertainments Duty Act 1953 [Act 103], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-11"};
  FT["MY-H5374"] = {"id":"MY-H5374","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 386/2023&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年价格管制与反暴利（最高价格核定）（第16号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 16) ORDER 2023","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 16) ORDER 2023","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Bilangan 16) 2023","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá tối đa) (số 16) năm 2023","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาสูงสุด) (ฉบับที่ 16) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Nomor 16) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA386","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2023_P.U.(A)386-2023_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 16) ORDER 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5374-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga\ndan Antipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Maksimum) (No. 16) 2023.\n\n (2) Perintah ini berku at kuasa bagi tempoh mulai 23 Disember 202 3\nhingga 27 Disember 2023.\n\nHarga pengeluar maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H5374-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga pengeluar maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan\ndalam ruang  (1) Jadual Pertama bagi Negeri Sarawak, Negeri Sabah\ndan Wilayah Persekutuan Labuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan dan daerah\nsebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga borong maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H5374-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Harga borong maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Kedua bagi Negeri-Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia,  Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wilayah Persekutuan Labuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan\ndan daerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga runcit maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H5374-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Harga runcit maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) J adual Ketiga bagi  Negeri-Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia,  Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wilayah Persekutuan Labuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan\ndan daerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 16) ORDER 2023\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4\nof the Price Control and Anti-Profiteering Act 2011 [ Act 723 ], the Controller,\nwith the approval of the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-11"};
